<title>USA: Farallon group raises Strawbridge stake.</title>
<headline>Farallon group raises Strawbridge stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Farallon Capital Management LLC said Thursday it raised its stake in Strawbridge &amp; Clothier to 14.0 percent or 1,488,800 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 241,600 additional shares of Strawbridge between October 10 and 17 at prices ranging from $19.875 to $20.21 a share.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake in Strawbridge for investment purposes.</p>
